                                "sense_id": "28a7b2d7-f563-3f77-b7c7-0fad0a538fa7",
                                "text": "Man brauchte unsere Arbeitskraft\ndie Kraft die was am Fließband schafft\nWir Menschen waren nicht interessant\ndarum blieben wir euch unbekannt\nRamaramaramaramadah...\nGastarbeiter\nRamaramaramaramadah...\nGastarbeiter",
                                "translation": "They needed our manpower\nThe kind for use on the assembly line\nAs people we weren't of interest\nThat's why we remained strangers to you\nRamaramaramaramadah...\nGastarbeiter\nRamaramaramaramadah...\nGastarbeiter",
                                "english": "They needed our manpower\nThe kind for use on the assembly line\nAs people we weren't of interest\nThat's why we remained strangers to you\nRamaramaramaramadah...\nGastarbeiter\nRamaramaramaramadah...\nGastarbeiter"
